1
00:00:00,120 --> 00:00:09,932
Meet Scidecs TallyPrime Integration for Odoo 19: a free connector for Odoo operations and TallyPrime accounting, demonstrated here on a real test company.

2
00:00:10,302 --> 00:00:21,002
Each company has an Odoo control centre. Enable the required entities, choose direct or private-LAN connectivity, and set an explicit direction and source of truth.

3
00:00:21,372 --> 00:00:32,960
The same Tally company maintains accounts with inventory and GST. Synchronization uses Tally's native XML gateway, with no spreadsheets, scraping or repeated entry.

4
00:00:33,330 --> 00:00:43,742
A standard Odoo product is saved with its name, price, cost and SKU. The module detects the change and creates one durable outbound event automatically.

5
00:00:44,112 --> 00:00:56,372
Sync Now processes the event. TallyPrime opens its Stock Items register, where the same demo bearing appears. GUID and Alter ID mappings preserve identity beyond names.

6
00:00:56,742 --> 00:01:06,818
Odoo's outbound queue shows the record, attempt count and acknowledged state. Idempotency makes retries safe and prevents intentional duplicate creation.

7
00:01:07,188 --> 00:01:19,760
Inside Tally, the received item shows the exact name and part number, VID260906-BEARING, plus its statutory and supply details. This is live application evidence.

8
00:01:20,130 --> 00:01:32,702
This live Tally receipt preserves its account, party, amount and reference. The connector also supports invoices, bills, returns, payments, journals, contra and inventory allocations.

9
00:01:33,072 --> 00:01:44,780
Odoo logs current Tally-to-Odoo imports with direction, entity, message and status. Operators can search records, inspect evidence and trace products, ledgers or vouchers.

10
00:01:45,150 --> 00:01:56,426
Twenty entity types cover masters, sales, purchases, returns, payments, journals, opening stock, adjustments and warehouse transfers through Tally Stock Journal allocations.

11
00:01:56,796 --> 00:02:09,416
Durable queues, stable mappings, watermarks, echo protection and conflict policy support controlled replay. Repeatedly malformed inbound records move to quarantine instead of blocking progress.

12
00:02:09,786 --> 00:02:21,902
The LGPL-3 connector is free. Scidecs offers optional mapping, deployment, UAT and support, with complete architecture, operations and FAQ documentation included.

